#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:158
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"A few years ago this region was bustling with trade activity. Now it is "
"overrun with bandits and marauders. You should tread lightly here."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:159
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"This somewhat isolated region was thrown into chaos at the start of the "
"rebellion. Even in peacetime it was always beset by pirates but now it "
"houses a center of operations for countless pirate fleets."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:160
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"If the reports are true, this area has been under the control of pirates for"
" quite some time. Some traders still attempt to trade with the few "
"settlements that remain, but they do so at great risk."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:161
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"A few Federation-friendly planets still exist in this sector, but they are "
"constantly under attack by pirate raids. This is a dangerous sector, so be "
"careful."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:162
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived in pirate space. After the Rebel takeover, this sector has "
"been the stage for cruel raids and remains in the hands of pirates today. Be"
" careful."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:163
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"This sector is known for constant looting and raids on passing vessels. Your"
" crew would like to believe that if you behave like a pirate, they'll treat "
"you as their own and won't interfere with your passage."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:164
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"Previously, this sector was at the intersection of important trade routes, "
"but now traders prefer to avoid it due to the sudden increase in number of "
"pirates."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:165
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[8]"
msgstr ""
"The words \"Jolly Roger\" are carved into this sector's entrance beacon. "
"Perhaps it's worth reminding these savages what the Federation really is."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[9]"
msgstr ""
"This sector was already restless before the civil war, but now it's teeming "
"with all kinds of pirates. Best prepare for the worst."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:167
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[10]"
msgstr ""
"This sector can safely be called the home of pirates and marauders. Check "
"the shields and weapons are up to par in case oncoming ships are "
"\"accidentally\" interested in you."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[11]"
msgstr ""
"Robbery has taken hold of this sector. Here you're unlikely to take off "
"towards a peaceful merchant ship, but there are many here who would want to "
"dismantle your own ship for spare parts."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:169
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"START_BEACON_PIRATE\"]/text[12]"
msgstr ""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:177
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"STORE_PIRATE\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"A few small ships are visible on the vidscreen, and you almost activate "
"weapons targeting. However, sensors indicate they are simply honest "
"merchants. The pirates must be making you jumpy. You message them asking "
"about their wares."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:178
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"STORE_PIRATE\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You detect a hub of activity nearby. A large corporation has set up a trade "
"depot and has a number of well armed ships patrolling. This appears to be a "
"relatively safe place to get repairs."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:179
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"STORE_PIRATE\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You receive a wide-band automated message, \"Welcome to our humble trade "
"depot and shipyard! All are welcome, but try any funny business and our 152 "
"automated turret satellites will tear your ship to shreds!\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:180
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"STORE_PIRATE\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"A well armed transport ship and a squadron of fighters are in orbit nearby. "
"You are wary of their trustworthiness but beggars can't be choosers."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:192
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_PIRATE\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"As soon as you arrive, a small ship de-cloaks behind yours. You immediately "
"power up the shields and weapons, but they continue on their trajectory "
"unimpressed. You try to calm your nerves."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:193
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_PIRATE\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"A small pirate ship messages you, \"That sure is a shiny ship you got "
"there.\" You fire a warning shot across their bow and they respond, \"Hey! "
"No need for violence! It was just a comment...\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:194
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_PIRATE\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"The only thing within scanning range is an old abandoned mining structure "
"and a resupply station. They appear to have been picked clean by marauders."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:195
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"NOTHING_PIRATE\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"You arrive to have a small fleet of Engi ships target you with a message, "
"\"Piracy results in negative societal impact. Not permitted.\" You assure "
"them of your honest intentions and they allow you to pass."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:212
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"As you jump into the system a pirate advances on your position. They are "
"refusing all hails. Prepare for a fight."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:213
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Soon after arriving in the system you are hailed by a small cruiser. \"What "
"good fortune that we happen to run into each other. Nothing personal, but "
"you have some information we need!\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:215
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"The only other ship at this beacon messages you: \"Finally, after months of "
"waiting, someone has fallen into our trap!\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:216
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"You barely have time to register jump completion before your ship warns you "
"of an incoming ship with weapons hot."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:218
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:223
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_NO_ESCAPE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Once you arrive, your screen lights up with warnings. A nearby pirate seems "
"to have advanced hacking tools and they have tried to shut down your "
"engines. Your crew manages to keep them barely operational and you move into"
" attack."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:232
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_NO_ESCAPE\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\"]/text"
msgstr "(Hacking) Counter the remote hacking."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:234
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_NO_ESCAPE\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your Hacking System automatically counters the digital assault and you move "
"in to fight the ship."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:255
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Aid the civilians."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:257
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You power up your weapons and engage the pirate ship."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:263
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Stay away from them."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:265
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The fight brings them out of your immediate scanning range. After a time the"
" distress calls stop."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:270
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You arrive in the system to see a pirate ship pursuing a civilian ship. You "
"detect messages from the civilian ship on a distress frequency."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:271
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Scanners indicate that a battle is taking place nearby. It seems that "
"someone is under attack by space pirates."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:272
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You detect two ships, one chasing the other... Scanners show the pursuer is "
"a pirate!"

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:273
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"There are only two ships within range and they seem to be engaged in battle."
" One of them has the markings of a space pirate."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:274
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the next beacon only to be immediately hailed by a small "
"shuttle. \"Help us! We are being attacked by pirates!\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:275
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_CIVILIAN\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"You come out of the jump to see laser blasts coming from the other side of "
"the beacon. It looks like someone is under attack from pirates."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:279
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"SAVE_CIVILIAN_LIST\"]/event[1]/text"
