#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:385
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[1]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Destroy the ship and salvage it."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:387
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[1]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You strip the ship of anything useful and leave its crew to hope help "
"arrives."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:392
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[1]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"Use the leverage you gained by saving their lives to convince them to delay "
"the pursuing fleet."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:394
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[1]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "Hopefully that will buy you more time to get to the next sector."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:400
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You were too late. A hull breach deprived the crew of oxygen during your "
"fight with the pirate. You salvage what you can."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:404
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"The pirate's victim quickly jumps away before you have a chance to speak to "
"them."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:407
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[4]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank you for the aid! I'm a trader that usually only works with Rebels, "
"but considering the circumstances I'll make an exception.\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:414
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER_WIN\"]/event[5]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank the heavens you showed up! We don't have much to offer as a reward, "
"but our engineer should be proficient enough to patch your ship up a bit "
"after that nasty fight.\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:419
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You come across a pirate in hot pursuit of an unidentified ship. You quickly"
" receive a transmission from the pirate: \"Stay out of this fight and we'll "
"make it worth your while.\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:420
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"An unidentified ship is badly damaged and still being assaulted by a space "
"pirate. The victim begins a distress message until the pirate cuts in and "
"offers to split the bounty if you sit tight."

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:421
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"PIRATE_BRIBER\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"A missile shoots across your bow when the jump completes. Your scans quickly"
" reveal a ship with pirate markings pursuing an unknown vessel. The pirate "
"hails you: \"Damn it, we weren't expecting company. Stay out of this and you"
" could profit.\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:429
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"PIRATE_CHOICE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Upon completing your jump, you receive a message from a nearby ship. "
"\"Greetings and welcome to our beacon! For a small fee, we'll let you "
"continue on your way.\""

#: src-ru/data/events_pirate.xml.rawclobber:432
